<h1>About Tattoo Art Customs</h1>
<p>Tattoo Art Customs is a marketplace for original tattoo designs — hundreds of premade pieces plus custom designs drawn to order ($150, or $125 during the Saturday sale; 50% deposit, 48-hour delivery).</p>
<h2>For design artists</h2>
<p>Join for <strong>$5/month</strong>: upload your art, write an artist bio, and earn <strong>70% commission</strong> on every sale of your designs. You must be registered, subscribed, and have a payout method set up to receive payouts.</p>
<h2>For tattoo shops</h2>
<p>Join for <strong>$99.99/year</strong>: get a referral link and earn <strong>20% on every verified sale</strong> you refer. Verified shops may list their business location, hours, and appointment requirements.</p>
<h2>House rules</h2>
<ul>
  <li>All contact stays through the site — no off-site emails, phones, socials, or payment info in bios, profiles, or messages.</li>
  <li>Off-site sales mean membership cancellation with no refund.</li>
  <li>All sales, subscriptions, and memberships are final.</li>
</ul>
